{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J6ZLABXHizeg4FdaTen8ik","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"use client\";\n2\t\n3\timport { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \"react\";\n4\timport Image from \"next/image\";\n5\timport Lightbox from \"yet-another-react-lightbox\";\n6\timport Zoom from \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/zoom\";\n7\timport Counter from \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/counter\";\n8\timport \"yet-another-react-lightbox/styles.css\";\n9\timport \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/counter.css\";\n10\timport {\n11\t  galleryImages,\n12\t  galleryCategories,\n13\t  type GalleryCategoryId,\n14\t  type GalleryImage,\n15\t} from \"@/data/gallery\";\n16\t\n17\tfunction GalleryThumbnail({\n18\t  image,\n19\t  index,\n20\t  onClick,\n21\t}: {\n22\t  image: GalleryImage;\n23\t  index: number;\n24\t  onClick: (index: number) => void;\n25\t}) {\n26\t  return (\n27\t    <button\n28\t      type=\"button\"\n29\t      onClick={() => onClick(index)}\n30\t      className=\"relative aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-600\"\n31\t      aria-label={`View photo: ${image.alt}`}\n32\t    >\n33\t      <Image\n34\t        src={image.src}\n35\t        alt={image.alt}\n36\t        fill\n37\t        sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 25vw\"\n38\t        className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\"\n39\t        loading=\"lazy\"\n40\t      />\n41\t      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/20 transition-colors duration-300\" />\n42\t      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">\n43\t        <svg\n44\t          className=\"w-8 h-8 text-white drop-shadow-lg\"\n45\t          fill=\"none\"\n46\t          stroke=\"currentColor\"\n47\t          viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n48\t          aria-hidden=\"true\"\n49\t        >\n50\t          <path\n51\t            strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n52\t            strokeLinejoin=\"round\"\n53\t            strokeWidth={2}\n54\t            d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7\"\n55\t          />\n56\t        </svg>\n57\t      </div>\n58\t    </button>\n59\t  );\n60\t}\n61\t\n62\texport default function PhotoGallery() {\n63\t  const [lightboxOpen, setLightboxOpen] = useState(false);\n64\t  const [lightboxIndex, setLightboxIndex] = useState(0);\n65\t  const [activeCategory, setActiveCategory] = useState<GalleryCategoryId>(\"all\");\n66\t  const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(false);\n67\t  const sectionRef = useRef<HTMLElement>(null);\n68\t\n69\t  // Intersection Observer for lazy initialization\n70\t  useEffect(() => {\n71\t    const el = sectionRef.current;\n72\t    if (!el) return;\n73\t\n74\t    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n75\t      ([entry]) => {\n76\t        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n77\t          setIsVisible(true);\n78\t          observer.disconnect();\n79\t        }\n80\t      },\n81\t      { rootMargin: \"200px\" }\n82\t    );\n83\t\n84\t    observer.observe(el);\n85\t    return () => observer.disconnect();\n86\t  }, []);\n87\t\n88\t  const filteredImages =\n89\t    activeCategory === \"all\"\n90\t      ? galleryImages\n91\t      : galleryImages.filter((img) => img.category === activeCategory);\n92\t\n93\t  const lightboxSlides = filteredImages.map((img) => ({\n94\t    src: img.src,\n95\t    alt: img.alt,\n96\t    width: img.width,\n97\t    height: img.height,\n98\t  }));\n99\t\n100\t  const handleThumbnailClick = useCallback((index: number) => {\n101\t    setLightboxIndex(index);\n102\t    setLightboxOpen(true);\n103\t  }, []);\n104\t\n105\t  return (\n106\t    <section\n107\t      ref={sectionRef}\n108\t      className=\"py-16 bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-950\"\n109\t      aria-labelledby=\"gallery-heading\"\n110\t    >\n111\t      <div className=\"container-custom\">\n112\t        <div className=\"text-center mb-10\">\n113\t          <p className=\"section-label\">Gallery</p>\n114\t          <h2\n115\t            id=\"gallery-heading\"\n116\t            className=\"section-heading mb-4\"\n117\t          >\n118\t            Explore Our Space\n119\t          </h2>\n120\t          <p className=\"text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n121\t            Take a closer look at our capsule pods, shared facilities, and\n122\t            everything that makes Pelangi Capsule Hostel feel like home.\n123\t          </p>\n124\t        </div>\n125\t\n126\t        {/* Category filter */}\n127\t        <div\n128\t          className=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-10\"\n129\t          role=\"tablist\"\n130\t          aria-label=\"Filter gallery by category\"\n131\t        >\n132\t          {galleryCategories.map((cat) => (\n133\t            <button\n134\t              key={cat.id}\n135\t              role=\"tab\"\n136\t              aria-selected={activeCategory === cat.id}\n137\t              onClick={() => setActiveCategory(cat.id)}\n138\t              className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-600 ${\n139\t                activeCategory === cat.id\n140\t                  ? \"bg-amber-600 text-white\"\n141\t                  : \"bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\"\n142\t              }`}\n143\t            >\n144\t              {cat.label}\n145\t            </button>\n146\t          ))}\n147\t        </div>\n148\t\n149\t        {/* Gallery grid */}\n150\t        {isVisible && (\n151\t          <div\n152\t            className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"\n153\t            role=\"tabpanel\"\n154\t            aria-label={`${galleryCategories.find((c) => c.id === activeCategory)?.label} photos`}\n155\t          >\n156\t            {filteredImages.map((image, index) => (\n157\t              <GalleryThumbnail\n158\t                key={image.src}\n159\t                image={image}\n160\t                index={index}\n161\t                onClick={handleThumbnailClick}\n162\t              />\n163\t            ))}\n164\t          </div>\n165\t        )}\n166\t\n167\t        {!isVisible && (\n168\t          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n169\t            {Array.from({ length: 8 }).map((_, i) => (\n170\t              <div\n171\t                key={i}\n172\t                className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl bg-stone-200 dark:bg-stone-800 animate-pulse\"\n173\t              />\n174\t            ))}\n175\t          </div>\n176\t        )}\n177\t      </div>\n178\t\n179\t      {/* Lightbox */}\n180\t      <Lightbox\n181\t        open={lightboxOpen}\n182\t        close={() => setLightboxOpen(false)}\n183\t        index={lightboxIndex}\n184\t        slides={lightboxSlides}\n185\t        plugins={[Zoom, Counter]}\n186\t        animation={{ fade: 300 }}\n187\t        carousel={{ finite: true }}\n188\t        controller={{ closeOnBackdropClick: true }}\n189\t        labels={{\n190\t          Next: \"Next photo\",\n191\t          Previous: \"Previous photo\",\n192\t          Close: \"Close gallery\",\n193\t        }}\n194\t      />\n195\t    </section>\n196\t  );\n197\t}\n198\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"650472e5-a1e2-490b-836b-3f33e6c52d9d","uuid":"3d8e5a1c-1a68-4801-9919-be37e7cb7579","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:10:56.117Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\components\\PhotoGallery.tsx","content":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport Image from \"next/image\";\nimport Lightbox from \"yet-another-react-lightbox\";\nimport Zoom from \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/zoom\";\nimport Counter from \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/counter\";\nimport \"yet-another-react-lightbox/styles.css\";\nimport \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/counter.css\";\nimport {\n  galleryImages,\n  galleryCategories,\n  type GalleryCategoryId,\n  type GalleryImage,\n} from \"@/data/gallery\";\n\nfunction GalleryThumbnail({\n  image,\n  index,\n  onClick,\n}: {\n  image: GalleryImage;\n  index: number;\n  onClick: (index: number) => void;\n}) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      type=\"button\"\n      onClick={() => onClick(index)}\n      className=\"relative aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-600\"\n      aria-label={`View photo: ${image.alt}`}\n    >\n      <Image\n        src={image.src}\n        alt={image.alt}\n        fill\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 25vw\"\n        className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/20 transition-colors duration-300\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">\n        <svg\n          className=\"w-8 h-8 text-white drop-shadow-lg\"\n          fill=\"none\"\n          stroke=\"currentColor\"\n          viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n          aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        >\n          <path\n            strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n            strokeLinejoin=\"round\"\n            strokeWidth={2}\n            d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7\"\n          />\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default function PhotoGallery() {\n  const [lightboxOpen, setLightboxOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [lightboxIndex, setLightboxIndex] = useState(0);\n  const [activeCategory, setActiveCategory] = useState<GalleryCategoryId>(\"all\");\n  const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(false);\n  const sectionRef = useRef<HTMLElement>(null);\n\n  // Intersection Observer for lazy initialization\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const el = sectionRef.current;\n    if (!el) return;\n\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n      ([entry]) => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          setIsVisible(true);\n          observer.disconnect();\n        }\n      },\n      { rootMargin: \"200px\" }\n    );\n\n    observer.observe(el);\n    return () => observer.disconnect();\n  }, []);\n\n  const filteredImages =\n    activeCategory === \"all\"\n      ? galleryImages\n      : galleryImages.filter((img) => img.category === activeCategory);\n\n  const lightboxSlides = filteredImages.map((img) => ({\n    src: img.src,\n    alt: img.alt,\n    width: img.width,\n    height: img.height,\n  }));\n\n  const handleThumbnailClick = useCallback((index: number) => {\n    setLightboxIndex(index);\n    setLightboxOpen(true);\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <section\n      ref={sectionRef}\n      className=\"py-16 bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-950\"\n      aria-labelledby=\"gallery-heading\"\n    >\n      <div className=\"container-custom\">\n        <div className=\"text-center mb-10\">\n          <p className=\"section-label\">Gallery</p>\n          <h2\n            id=\"gallery-heading\"\n            className=\"section-heading mb-4\"\n          >\n            Explore Our Space\n          </h2>\n          <p className=\"text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n            Take a closer look at our capsule pods, shared facilities, and\n            everything that makes Pelangi Capsule Hostel feel like home.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Category filter */}\n        <div\n          className=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-10\"\n          role=\"tablist\"\n          aria-label=\"Filter gallery by category\"\n        >\n          {galleryCategories.map((cat) => (\n            <button\n              key={cat.id}\n              role=\"tab\"\n              aria-selected={activeCategory === cat.id}\n              onClick={() => setActiveCategory(cat.id)}\n              className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-600 ${\n                activeCategory === cat.id\n                  ? \"bg-amber-600 text-white\"\n                  : \"bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\"\n              }`}\n            >\n              {cat.label}\n            </button>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Gallery grid */}\n        {isVisible && (\n          <div\n            className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"\n            role=\"tabpanel\"\n            aria-label={`${galleryCategories.find((c) => c.id === activeCategory)?.label} photos`}\n          >\n            {filteredImages.map((image, index) => (\n              <GalleryThumbnail\n                key={image.src}\n                image={image}\n                index={index}\n                onClick={handleThumbnailClick}\n              />\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        )}\n\n        {!isVisible && (\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n            {Array.from({ length: 8 }).map((_, i) => (\n              <div\n                key={i}\n                className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl bg-stone-200 dark:bg-stone-800 animate-pulse\"\n              />\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Lightbox */}\n      <Lightbox\n        open={lightboxOpen}\n        close={() => setLightboxOpen(false)}\n        index={lightboxIndex}\n        slides={lightboxSlides}\n        plugins={[Zoom, Counter]}\n        animation={{ fade: 300 }}\n        carousel={{ finite: true }}\n        controller={{ closeOnBackdropClick: true }}\n        labels={{\n          Next: \"Next photo\",\n          Previous: \"Previous photo\",\n          Close: \"Close gallery\",\n        }}\n      />\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","numLines":198,"startLine":1,"totalLines":198}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_015VCyy5boMxUxVyrVrdaAJU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So PhotoGallery uses a grid layout with the yet-another-react-lightbox library. It's not a scroll carousel, so it doesn't need the native scroll-driven carousel implementation.\n\nThe Gallery.tsx component is the one that uses the carousel-scroll-container. \n\nLooking at the current state:\n1. Gallery.tsx has ScrollSection components that render horizontal scrollable carousels\n2. The CSS already has ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker styles defined with @supports\n3. The Gallery.tsx still has manual JS buttons for scroll left/right\n\nThe question is: what exactly needs to be implemented for US-187?\n\nLooking at the acceptance criteria again:\n1. \"Gallery carousel uses scroll-snap CSS with ::scroll-button() for prev/next controls\" - The CSS is there, but the Gallery.tsx still has JS buttons\n2. \"::scroll-marker group provides keyboard-accessible dot indicators\" - The CSS is there, but I don't see any HTML dots being rendered\n3. \"Fallback for non-supporting browsers degrades to scrollable overflow without JS errors\" - The fallback CSS is there\n4. \"@supports query wraps the new pseudo-element declarations\" - Already done\n5. \"Lighthouse reports no layout shift (CLS=0) from carousel on load\" - Need to verify\n\nThe problem is that the ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker pseudo-elements don't actually exist in any browser yet. They're part of a CSS specification that's still being developed.\n\nSo the strategy here is:\n- These pseudo-elements are aspirational (future feature for Chrome 135+)\n- The CSS is already prepared for them\n- When Chrome 135+ releases, these pseudo-elements will automatically be rendered by the browser\n- Until then, the JS fallback is used\n\nI think the task is to:\n1. Ensure the CSS is correct and complete\n2. Verify that Gallery.tsx is using the carousel-scroll-container class properly\n3. Test that the fallback works without JS errors\n\n\n4. Add documentation noting this implementation is forward-compatible with Chrome 135+. Now I should review the carousel CSS to see if there are any gaps or refinements needed.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2551,"cache_read_input_tokens":82438,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2551},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"650472e5-a1e2-490b-836b-3f33e6c52d9d","uuid":"6a8ccb37-db1f-4035-bf53-20dc407a8372"}
