{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016TBoj7MnjD53hYqtKs4rE9","type":"tool_result","content":"   CSS Native Scroll-Driven Carousel (US-187)\n   Chrome 135+ proposed ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker\n   pseudo-elements for automatic ARIA button roles and\n   keyboard handling. Wrapped in @supports guard for future.\n   Current fallback: scroll-snap CSS with hidden scrollbar.\n   Ensures CLS=0 via fixed aspect-ratio on carousel items.\n   Reference: https://developer.chrome.com/blog/carousels-with-css\n   Spec: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-5/#scroll-marker-group\n   ============================================================ */\n\n/* Future Chrome 135+ native scroll-driven carousel support */\n@supports (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container > * {\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    scroll-snap-stop: always;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Automatic scroll prev/next buttons with built-in ARIA roles */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(prev) {\n    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md\n           flex items-center justify-center\n           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\n           transition-colors cursor-pointer;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(next) {\n    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md\n           flex items-center justify-center\n           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\n           transition-colors cursor-pointer;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  /* Automatic scroll marker group for keyboard-accessible navigation dots */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item {\n    @apply w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stone-300 dark:bg-stone-600\n           cursor-pointer transition-colors;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item[aria-current=\"true\"] {\n    @apply bg-amber-600 dark:bg-amber-400;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Fallback: browsers without ::scroll-button() support degrade gracefully */\n@supports not (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;\n[rerun: b3]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"650472e5-a1e2-490b-836b-3f33e6c52d9d","uuid":"554e7f6d-4081-4f80-8305-7861097bda8c","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:11:32.941Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"   CSS Native Scroll-Driven Carousel (US-187)\n   Chrome 135+ proposed ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker\n   pseudo-elements for automatic ARIA button roles and\n   keyboard handling. Wrapped in @supports guard for future.\n   Current fallback: scroll-snap CSS with hidden scrollbar.\n   Ensures CLS=0 via fixed aspect-ratio on carousel items.\n   Reference: https://developer.chrome.com/blog/carousels-with-css\n   Spec: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-5/#scroll-marker-group\n   ============================================================ */\n\n/* Future Chrome 135+ native scroll-driven carousel support */\n@supports (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container > * {\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    scroll-snap-stop: always;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Automatic scroll prev/next buttons with built-in ARIA roles */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(prev) {\n    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md\n           flex items-center justify-center\n           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\n           transition-colors cursor-pointer;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(next) {\n    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md\n           flex items-center justify-center\n           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\n           transition-colors cursor-pointer;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  /* Automatic scroll marker group for keyboard-accessible navigation dots */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item {\n    @apply w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stone-300 dark:bg-stone-600\n           cursor-pointer transition-colors;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item[aria-current=\"true\"] {\n    @apply bg-amber-600 dark:bg-amber-400;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Fallback: browsers without ::scroll-button() support degrade gracefully */\n@supports not (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
