{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011XcjSmNbKZM7UNygdBiDmp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis of the codebase, let me provide my diagnosis:\n\n## Current State\n\nThe project already has CSS for a native scroll-driven carousel prepared for Chrome 135+ with:\n- `globals.css` containing complete `::scroll-button()` and `::scroll-marker` pseudo-element styles wrapped in `@supports (selector(::scroll-button(*)))` guard (lines 151-245)\n- `Gallery.tsx` using the `carousel-scroll-container` class on all carousel instances\n- Fallback CSS for browsers without support that gracefully degrades to scrollable containers\n- Manual JavaScript scroll buttons in ScrollSection component providing current functionality\n\n## Problem Identified\n\nStory US-187 requires verifying and completing the CSS native scroll-driven carousel implementation that is **future-proofed for Chrome 135+**. The CSS pseudo-elements `::scroll-button()` and `::scroll-marker` don't exist in any current browser, but the specification is real and Chrome 135 (March 2025) will ship support. The current implementation is partially complete but needs:\n\n1. Verification that all acceptance criteria are satisfied\n2. Confirmation that CSS handles the dynamic scroll marker states correctly\n3. Validation that there's zero Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) during carousel initialization\n4. Ensuring the code is properly documented for future Chrome 135+ support\n\n## Planned Changes\n\n- **`site/src/app/globals.css`**: Add enhanced scroll marker styling to properly handle active state transitions and ensure ::scroll-marker-item with aria-current=\"true\" styling is visually distinct\n- **`site/src/components/Gallery.tsx`**: Verify carousel items have proper fixed dimensions to prevent CLS and ensure no layout shift on load\n- **`prd.json`**: Mark story as passes: true once all acceptance criteria verified\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [\"site/src/app/globals.css\", \"site/src/components/Gallery.tsx\"],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 30\n}\n</plan>\n\nNow let me verify the implementation and ensure all acceptance criteria are met:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":89569,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":834},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"650472e5-a1e2-490b-836b-3f33e6c52d9d","uuid":"7869d736-b2fb-49d6-b3da-48c979d82ed5"}
