{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_012kycKpTyurvULYvgyhJANq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! All carousel items have proper aspect ratios and fixed dimensions:\n1. Hostel photos: w-72 md:w-80 aspect-video\n2. Guest photos: w-40 md:w-48 aspect-square  \n3. Destination photos: w-64 md:w-72 aspect-video\n\nThis ensures CLS=0 (no layout shift) because all dimensions are fixed before the images load.\n\nNow, let me verify the CSS is complete and correct for all the acceptance criteria:\n\nAC1: \"Gallery carousel uses scroll-snap CSS with ::scroll-button() for prev/next controls\"\n✓ Carousels use carousel-scroll-container class\n✓ CSS has scroll-snap-type: x mandatory\n✓ CSS has ::scroll-button(prev) and ::scroll-button(next)\n\nAC2: \"::scroll-marker group provides keyboard-accessible dot indicators\"\n✓ CSS has ::scroll-marker (flex container for dots)\n✓ CSS has ::scroll-marker-item (individual dot styling)\n✓ CSS has ::scroll-marker-item[aria-current=\"true\"] for active state\n\nAC3: \"Fallback for non-supporting browsers degrades to scrollable overflow without JS errors\"\n✓ @supports not (selector(::scroll-button(*))) has fallback CSS\n✓ Gallery.tsx has manual JS buttons for fallback\n\nAC4: \"@supports query wraps the new pseudo-element declarations\"\n✓ Lines 163-224 in globals.css have @supports (selector(::scroll-button(*)))\n✓ Lines 227-245 have @supports not (selector(::scroll-button(*)))\n\nAC5: \"Lighthouse reports no layout shift (CLS=0) from carousel on load\"\n✓ All carousel items have fixed dimensions (aspect-ratio + fixed widths)\n✓ No images will cause layout shift on load\n\nEverything looks complete! The only thing I need to do is mark the story as passes: true in prd.json after verifying everything compiles correctly.\n\n\nNow I should run a build to check for any compilation errors before finalizing.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":911,"cache_read_input_tokens":92852,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":911},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"650472e5-a1e2-490b-836b-3f33e6c52d9d","uuid":"86cbea3d-8925-479c-8996-e2392fc710d8"}
